## Visual concept used
SIXTH Cognitive Enhancement poster; inherits the locked **"Neural Signal Schematic"** pillar style verbatim (ink field, cyan = live/earned base, amber = caution, ONE scarce red, dim grey = inactive, JetBrains-Mono labels / Inter headline). New sub-archetype = a **landscape STAGED COMMISSIONING BOARD** — a left→right power-on sequence that builds and energizes a brain's base supply in a locked order (distinct from 1.0's portrait unpopulated blueprint, 1.1's tuning bench, 4.0's vertical escalation power-supply, 4.1's dual-rail engine, 4.2's overdrive console, 4.3's swap patch-bay). It is the only Cognitive poster whose hero action is **REMOVING input to DRAIN a reservoir** and whose spine is a **locked interlocked SEQUENCE**.

Layout: a top **POWER-ON SEQUENCE RAIL** (① DRAIN → ② ATTACH REWARD ±STIM → ③ CONSOLIDATE, with ENABLE interlocks + the master plate `BEHAVIOUR FIRST · PERFORMANCE SECOND · HARDWARE THIRD`). **Left HERO = the baseline reservoir + contrast comparator** drawn as a before→after pair: a FLOODED tank (amber, high charge) fed by four unequal-bore cheap-hit leak injectors (short-form video fattest → porn → sugar/novelty → notifications), its `REAL WORK` ramp peaking *below* the threshold so the REWARD lamp reads dark; then, after closing the valves + opening a DRAIN, a DRAINED tank (cyan, low floor) where the same ramp *clears* the lowered line and REWARD fires — engraved law `DOPAMINE = CONTRAST, NOT ABSOLUTE LEVEL`, amber transitional note (days 2–4 flat = draining; boredom = sensitivity returning). **Center = Stage 2** (the in-order cyan amplifier tapping the primed real-work signal, "added on a system primed to receive it") sitting above **the single RED fault** (a stimulant jumpered *past* the locked Stage-1 interlock into a still-flooded baseline → red output lamp `JITTERS, NOT FOCUS`), then dim **Stage 3** (slow Lion's-Mane consolidation, months not minutes, latched last) and the **habit-stamp** latched-write module (reward pulse on the rising/START edge, worked-coffee-cue example, amber `PROTECT THE CONTRAST` / `DON'T STAMP THE WRONG THING`, nicotine→Part 3.0 chip with tolerance tag). **Right = the READINESS GATE → Part 3** (five green toggles SLEEP · DOPAMINE BASELINE · MOVEMENT · MEASUREMENT · LOAD energizing the PHARMACOLOGY BUS, with the locked-state warning + a "the base is the win / the module you keep reaching for is the last one that turns on" plate). **Full-width foundation = the FIVE-INPUT POWER SUPPLY RAIL** of deliberately unequal gauge — SLEEP the thickest mains (with brown-out triplet LATENCY↑·ENDURANCE↓·FLEXIBILITY↓), CARDIO=BDNF, OMEGA-3/DHA dual-function (membrane build-brick `URIDINE+CHOLINE+DHA` shown amber-incomplete when DHA missing + an absorption-key gate), HYDRATION/FUEL smoothing (clean line vs ghosted spike→crash sawtooth), LOAD MGMT shielding. **Foot ribbon = the spiral** (Fitness→…→Income with the PRODUCTIVITY node lit + a return-loop arrow) + grace plates (OPTIONALITY & DESIGN NOT OUTPUT; DON'T MIN-MAX YOUR BRAIN) + capstone stencil `YOU OUT-BUILD A DEFAULT. YOU DON'T OUT-THINK IT.`

Colour rationed exactly per §5: cyan = drained reservoir + clearing real-work + healthy supply (sleep at full gauge) + in-order Stage-2 amp + green gate; amber = every non-central caution (leak injectors, drain days, brown-out, incomplete brick, dry-absorption, sawtooth, habit-stamp cautions, nicotine tolerance, min-max line); EXACTLY ONE red = the amplifier energized into a still-flooded baseline; dim grey = un-energized Stage-3 + ghosted/inactive paths. §7 respected: no glowing-brain/lightbulb/floating-pills, no "dopamine detox" monk/crossed-out-phone cliché (the mechanism is a draining bias reservoir on a commissioning board); the reset is framed as recalibration (the flat days are amber/transitional, never the alarm); the base is the hero (sleep is the thickest feed, the supply rail dwarfs the amp, stages read as a locked interlocked sequence, not a 5-habits checklist); the spiral stays a thin one-lit-node ribbon, not a competing growth chart.

